                        <div class="solutions-media">
                        <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/contact-us/circle-bg.webp" alt="" class="solutions-circle" aria-hidden="true" />
                        <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/contact-us/salad-bowl.webp" alt="Fresh salad bowl with vegetables" class="solutions-salad" />
                        </div>
                  
                        <!-- Copy -->
                        <div class="solutions-copy">
                        <p>At Nekta, we recognise that every requirement is distinct—and deserves a solution that is equally thoughtful. Whether you aim to elevate your corporate dining experience, develop a holistic hospital nutrition programme, manage the hospitality of a dynamic campus environment, or curate a seamless one-time event, our team is committed to partnering with you to deliver tailored, high-impact solutions.</p>
                  
                        <p>Reach out to us to explore how we can bring together expertise, innovation, and care to create solutions tailored to your needs. We look forward to starting a conversation that builds something exceptional.</p>
                  
                        <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/contact-us/leaf-icon.webp" alt="" class="solutions-leaf" aria-hidden="true" />
                        </div>
                  
                     </div>
                  
                     <!-- Decorative splash bleeding off the right edge -->
                     <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/contact-us/juice-splash.webp" alt="" class="solutions-splash" aria-hidden="true" />
                  
                  </div>
            </section>


